  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 20,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.056,
            0.183,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "150"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.427,
            0.054,
            0.592,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.09,
            0.904,
            0.215
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "用 Percoll（聚乙烯吡咯烷酮包被的硅颗粒）梯度进行叶绿体的分级分离，与蔗糖相比，Percoll 基本上不在梯度内产生渗透压，黏性也较蔗糖低，因而能缩短离心时间。成分中的聚乙二醇（PEG）可对破碎了的叶绿体及过氧化物酶体的条带密度造成影响，因而减小此类破碎细胞器对完整叶绿体的污染程度。PEG、Ficoll 和 BSA 有利于维持叶绿体的生物活性。叶绿体经 Percoll 分级分离后比较稳定，可在冰上保持数小时。叶绿体得率可通过检测叶绿素含量来确定。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.225,
            0.429,
            0.248
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.259,
            0.902,
            0.299
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）仪器、用具:玻璃匀浆器、高速冷冻离心机、大容量离心管及微量离心管、可见分光光度计、尼龙网、移液器、研钵（用于液氮）、石英砂。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.302,
            0.444,
            0.319
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料:新鲜菠菜或豌豆叶。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.323,
            0.253,
            0.34
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 试剂"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.341,
            0.623,
            0.804
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1) 匀浆悬浮缓冲液:\n2mmol/L EDTA (pH8.0)\n1mmol/L MgCl₂\n1mmol/L MnCl₂\n50mmol/L HEPES-KOH (pH8.0)\n0.33mol/L 山梨醇\n0.5g/L BSA (无脂肪酸)\n5mmol/L 抗坏血酸钠盐 (使用前添加)\n2) 50%PBF-Percoll 梯度:\n2mmol/L EDTA (pH8.0)\n1mmol/L MgCl₂\n1mmol/L MnCl₂\n50mmol/L HEPES-KOH (pH8.0)\n0.33mol/L 山梨醇\n50%Percoll (V/V)\n3%PEG6000 (m/V)\n1%BSA (无脂肪酸) (w/V)\n1%Ficoll (w/V)\n3) 1×SH:\n50mmol/LHEPES-KOH (pH8.0)\n0.33mol/L 山梨醇\n4) 丙酮。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.814,
            0.299,
            0.836
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.846,
            0.376,
            0.866
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（一）叶绿体的制备"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.878,
            0.909,
            0.898
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 梯度的制备:按照试剂 2）的配方制备 50% PBF-Percoll 梯度，在每个 50ml 离"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 21,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.383,
            0.052,
            0.619,
            0.069
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第九章 细胞化学成分的分离"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.826,
            0.053,
            0.862,
            0.068
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "151"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.087,
            0.894,
            0.126
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "心管中加入 25ml 的 PBF-Percoll 溶液。29 000g 离心 15min，即可形成梯度（制好的梯度可于 4℃下过夜存放）。"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.129,
            0.887,
            0.148
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料的准备: 菠菜或豌豆叶材料可直接购买, 或用种子进行水萌发, 光照培养。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.15,
            0.895,
            0.19
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）匀浆:取 50～100g 的叶组织，研钵中加液氮，迅速研磨几下（为增加研磨强度可添加少许石英砂），转入预冷的匀浆缓冲液匀浆，避免过度匀浆及产生泡沫。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.192,
            0.896,
            0.231
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）匀浆液用粗孔尼龙布过滤后，在大容量离心管或离心瓶中 2600g，4℃ 离心 5min，收集沉淀。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.234,
            0.898,
            0.294
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 用 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 匀浆缓冲液重悬沉淀（可使用软毛刷轻轻将管壁上的沉淀刷松），小心地加到做好的Percoll梯度上。"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10500 \\mathrm{~g}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 离心 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（应见到两条绿色带，上方的条带为破碎的叶绿体，接近底部的为完整叶绿体带）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.296,
            0.814,
            0.316
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) 将叶绿体带吸出，用 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\times \\mathrm{SH}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 洗涤几次，每次 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2400\\mathrm{g}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 离心，收集沉淀。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.318,
            0.34,
            0.336
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(7) 悬浮于  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\times SH"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.347,
            0.387,
            0.368
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（二）检测叶绿素含量"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.379,
            0.717,
            0.399
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1)  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  叶绿体悬液与  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "995\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  的 80% 丙酮在微量离心管中混匀。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.401,
            0.433,
            0.419
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 13 000g，室温离心 2min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.421,
            0.575,
            0.439
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 取溶液在 663nm 及 645nm 处检测吸光值。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.441,
            0.7,
            0.461
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) 计算:叶绿素含量 (mg/ml) = (8.02A_{663} + 20.2A_{645}) / 5。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.469,
            0.263,
            0.492
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【注意事项】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.504,
            0.9,
            0.564
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）植物细胞由细胞壁包围，因此分离叶绿体必须保证破碎细胞壁同时不破坏叶绿体的完整。因此采用液氮研磨加匀浆的方案（研磨时加入石英砂是为了增加机械剪切力）。注意不要研磨匀浆过度。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.566,
            0.9,
            0.606
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 菠菜与豌豆的质体较小, 而且都能在不积累淀粉和酶类物质的条件下生长。菠菜的叶绿体/湿重值较高, 而豌豆易于生长。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.607,
            0.901,
            0.647
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "对于那些叶绿体较大且形状不规则，或包埋在厚纤维组织中的细胞，可先酶解细胞壁，再破裂原生质体。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.649,
            0.888,
            0.703
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 使用的牛血清白蛋白（BSA）不能含有脂肪酸，以防止脂肪酸氧化造成膜溶解。\n【作业】"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.713,
            0.644,
            0.732
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "用梯度离心法分离、纯化叶绿体，并计算叶绿素含量。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.811,
            0.755,
            0.898,
            0.772
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(刘兵)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.287,
            0.811,
            0.73,
            0.835
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "实验 51 中期染色体的分离纯化"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.842,
            0.267,
            0.866
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验目的】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.876,
            0.903,
            0.896
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "用己二醇法或水相法分离培养细胞的中期染色体，同时用梯度法纯化制备的染色体"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 22,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.056,
            0.185,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "152"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.43,
            0.054,
            0.596,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.09,
            0.486,
            0.108
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "粗样品，以适用于生化检测及形态分析。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.12,
            0.268,
            0.143
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验原理】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.154,
            0.814,
            0.172
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "染色体的分离纯化对于研究染色质的结构以及生物性状具有重要的作用。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.176,
            0.907,
            0.238
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "分离有丝分裂染色体时的一个主要问题，是稳定染色体结构的同时，降低其他细胞结构的稳定性，从而制备染色体。所用的缓冲条件应温和以避免改变染色体的生化性质和形态。常用的方案包括聚胺法、水相法、己二醇法等。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.24,
            0.908,
            0.303
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "本实验介绍的己二醇法中，染色体主要靠己二醇来维持其稳定性，而无需处于高浓度条件下的二价阳离子（"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Ca^{2+}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "）。这种条件下，染色体能保持致密且形态稳定。在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 缓冲液中能保存几周。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.306,
            0.816,
            0.324
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "而水相法则采用近似生理条件的提取介质，以减少对染色体结构的破坏。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.327,
            0.911,
            0.412
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "通常用各种方法制备得到的粗制染色体样品，由于混有杂质，并不适用于直接进行一些生物学检测，而是必须将样品进行纯化。最主要的污染物一般是肌动蛋白和中间纤维成分的非染色体蛋白，以及细胞核和发生聚集的染色体。将染色体粗品悬液通过蔗糖梯度进行沉降能去除大部分污染。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.307,
            0.423,
            0.727,
            0.446
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "方法一 己二醇法分离中期染色体"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.455,
            0.437,
            0.477
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.488,
            0.91,
            0.529
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）仪器、用具:冷冻离心机、离心管、移液器及枪头、玻璃匀浆器、相差显微镜。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.532,
            0.382,
            0.55
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料:HeLa 细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.554,
            0.259,
            0.571
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 试剂"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.575,
            0.907,
            0.616
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）己二醇缓冲液:1mol/L 己二醇（2-甲基-2,4-戊二醇），0.5mmol/L CaCl₂，0.1mmol/L PIPES [哌嗪-N,N'-双（2-乙磺酸）] (pH6.5)。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.62,
            0.258,
            0.637
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）蔗糖。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.641,
            0.298,
            0.659
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）秋水仙素。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.671,
            0.302,
            0.694
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.706,
            0.913,
            0.79
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）有丝分裂过程中，细胞的同步化处理。在适宜的条件下培养细胞，收集处于有丝分裂前期 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10\\sim 16\\mathrm{h}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的细胞，在培养基中加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.06\\mu \\mathrm{g / ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的秋水仙素（有丝分裂指数应大于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，最好为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "80\\% \\sim 90\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，细胞应处于对数生长期，细胞密度不大于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "75\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的汇合）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.793,
            0.914,
            0.854
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2)  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , 1000g 离心 10min, 用 10ml 培养基重悬, 重悬细胞在  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  放置 20min (低温以促进有丝分裂复合物包括微管的完全解离),  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , 1000g 离心 4min, 收集细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.857,
            0.689,
            0.875
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 用预冷的己二醇缓冲液清洗细胞，按第（2）步离心。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.879,
            0.701,
            0.897
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) 10ml 预冷的己二醇缓冲液重悬细胞，37℃温浴 10min。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 23,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.39,
            0.054,
            0.628,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第九章 细胞化学成分的分离"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.836,
            0.056,
            0.871,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "153"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.09,
            0.903,
            0.131
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（5）细胞悬液在玻璃匀浆器中匀浆10次，匀浆液于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，3000g离心15min进行浓缩，重新悬浮后，即得到染色体粗样品。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.133,
            0.904,
            0.195
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（6）蔗糖梯度的制备:在己二醇缓冲液中加入蔗糖，分别制成 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "40\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "60\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 几种蔗糖浓度，小心地加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50\\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 离心管中，制成不连续梯度，梯度的总体积应不超过离心管容积的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2/3"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.198,
            0.745,
            0.217
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(7) 将得到的染色体粗样品轻轻加到梯度上, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2500 \\mathrm{~g}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 离心 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "15 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.22,
            0.904,
            0.283
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "通常可溶性细胞成分以及细胞骨架留在顶层，细胞核及聚集的染色体会沉到底部，而纯化的染色体迁移到梯度中间（大约 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的蔗糖浓度梯度处），形成一条弥散的白色条带（取少量样品，可用相差显微镜检测染色体的情况）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.285,
            0.563,
            0.304
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(8) 收集染色体区带，3000g 离心进行浓缩。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.306,
            0.464,
            0.326
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(9) 用微量的己二醇缓冲液重悬。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.314,
            0.337,
            0.707,
            0.36
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "方法二 水相法分离中期染色体"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.368,
            0.431,
            0.392
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.402,
            0.904,
            0.443
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）仪器、用具:冷冻离心机、离心管、移液器及枪头、玻璃匀浆器、相差显微镜。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.446,
            0.377,
            0.465
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料:HeLa 细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.467,
            0.255,
            0.486
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 试剂"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.489,
            0.908,
            0.552
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）水相裂解缓冲液:10mmol/L Tris-HCl（pH7.4），120mmol/L KCl，20mmol/L NaCl，0.1% Triton X-100，0.1mmol/L PMSF（苯甲基磺酰氟，含2mmol/L CaCl₂）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.555,
            0.346,
            0.574
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2) 75mmol/L KCl。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.576,
            0.253,
            0.596
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）蔗糖。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.598,
            0.293,
            0.618
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4）秋水仙素。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.628,
            0.295,
            0.652
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.663,
            0.773,
            0.683
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）细胞的同步化处理，同“己二醇法分离中期染色体”步骤（1）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.685,
            0.813,
            0.705
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 细胞的收集及预冷处理，同“己二醇法分离中期染色体”步骤（2）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.707,
            0.905,
            0.746
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 低渗溶胀: 细胞沉淀悬浮于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "75 \\mathrm{mmol} / \\mathrm{L} \\mathrm{KCl}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 溶液中, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 孵育 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 进行低渗处理。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.75,
            0.577,
            0.768
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "注:某些细胞系要求 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "40\\sim 60\\mathrm{mmol / L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " KCl的低渗条件。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.771,
            0.494,
            0.79
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 1000g 离心收集溶胀细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.792,
            0.7,
            0.811
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 细胞悬浮于水相裂解缓冲液中，温和搅匀，冰浴 5min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.814,
            0.745,
            0.833
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) 细胞悬液温和地用注射器抽吸 10 次，或用玻璃匀浆器匀浆。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.835,
            0.566,
            0.854
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(7) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "400 \\mathrm{~g}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 离心去除细胞核, 收集上清。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.857,
            0.541,
            0.876
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(8) 上清以  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " C，3000g 离心收集染色体。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 27,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.878,
            0.508,
            0.898
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(9) 染色体可进一步纯化或进行检测。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
